   Teixeira, Elisabete R.; Mateus, Ricardo; Camoes, Aires F.; Braganca, Luis, Univ Minho, CTAC, Dept Civil Engn, Sch Engn, P-4800058 Guimaraes, Portugal.
   Branco, Fernando G., Univ Coimbra, INESC Coimbra, Dept Civil Engn, P-3030788 Coimbra, Portugal.
